;
(k)
"health science" means the modern and Indian systems of medicine in all their branches concerning preventive,
promotive, curative and rehabilitative services;

(l)
"hostel" means a unit of residence for the students of the University maintained or recognised by the University in
accordance with the conditions prescribed;
(m)
"Indian systems of medicine" include Ayurveda, Unani, Homeopathy, Naturopathy, Yoga and such other disciplines as
may be prescribed;
(n)
"institution" means an academic institution, not being a college, maintained by the University;
