(o)
"modern medicine" means allopathic medicine inclusive of dental medicine, dealing with different subjects in non-clinical,
para-clinical and clinical specialities and includes training of para-medical personnel at the collegiate level in nursing,
genetics, bio-medical and Public Health Engineering;
(p)
"notification" means a notification published in the [Telangana]
