5. The Executive Council shall have the following powers, namely:-
(1)
to make Statutes and amend or repeal the Statutes;
(2)
to co-operate with other Universities, academic authorities and Colleges in such manner and for such purposes as it
may determine;
(3)
to provide for research and advancement and dissemination of knowledge in Health Sciences and allied fields and for
this purpose to establish such Colleges, Departments and Institutions as may be considered necessary, from time to
time, in addition to those specified in the First Schedule;
(4)
to institute lecturer-ships, readerships, professor-ships and any other teaching or research posts required by the
University;
(5)
